<view class="page home"><view class="brand"><image src="/assets/bird.webp" mode="aspectFit"/>叽咕插画</view><view class="hero"><view class="title">把今天的小故事，画下来。</view><view class="sub">几张照片，一段小事，<br/>就能做成一本宝宝的成长小书。</view><view class="hero-wrap" bindtap="sample" role="button" aria-label="看看小书示例"><image class="hero-art" src="/assets/home-hero.webp" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="sample-hint">翻开看看 · 画面示意</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">{{freeAvailable ? '免费做第一本' : '做一本小书'}}</button><view class="tiny center">{{freeAvailable ? '首本 5 页免费，先留住一个小瞬间' : '5 页 ¥3.9 · 7 页 ¥5.9 · 10 页 ¥7.9'}}<br/>照片和小书，只有你能看到</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view class="row section"><view class="section-title">最近的小书</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="shelf">我的小书 ›</button></view><view class="grid" wx:if="{{books.length}}"><view wx:for="{{books}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="open" data-index="{{index}}"><view class="cover"><image wx:if="{{item.cover}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><image wx:else src="/assets/bird.webp" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="cover-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.date}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty">书架还空着，等一个可爱的小日常。</view><button class="footer-entry" bindtap="products">叽咕其他产品 · 一起读英语绘本 ›</button></view>